      "name": "service.test.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/test/account/service.test.ts",
      "summary": "验证 OpenCode 应用与兼容层 的行为，实际用例包括「login resolves origin-rooted verification URLs from servers with base paths、login rejects malformed device verification URLs、login maps transport failures to account transport errors、orgsByAccount groups orgs per account、remove switches to another org when the active account is removed、token refresh persists the new token、token refreshes before expiry when inside the eager refresh window」。",
      "tags": [
        "test",
        "应用",
        "测试辅助"
      ],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
